# Whole app screens, not component art: the captures and the boards built
# from them stay local. gen.py builds the other 13 boards without them.
# assets/art/ IS committed -- every piece of it is a measured crop, and
# without it the boards have no artwork at all. So is assets/art-gen/, which
# is the evidence behind board 00e and is not used by any screen.
ref-*.html
assets/refs/
